msgid ""
"Over time, a documentation project may want to rename and move contents "
"around. Redirects allow changes in a documentation project to happen "
"without bad user experiences."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:7
msgid ""
"If you do not manage URL structures, users will eventually encounter 404 "
"File Not Found errors. While this may be acceptable in some cases, the "
"bad user experience of a 404 page is usually best to avoid."
msgstr ""

