#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:184
msgid "Redirecting a directory"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:186
msgid ""
"Say you rename the ``/api/`` directory to ``/api/v1/``. Instead of "
"creating a redirect for each page in the directory, you can use a "
"wildcard to redirect all pages in that directory::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:196
msgid ""
"From ``https://docs.example.com/en/latest/api/`` to "
"``https://docs.example.com/en/latest/api/v1/``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:198
msgid ""
"From ``https://docs.example.com/en/latest/api/projects.html`` to "
"``https://docs.example.com/en/latest/api/v1/projects.html``."
