#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:213
msgid "Redirecting a directory to a single page"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/user-defined-redirects.rst:215
msgid ""
"Say you put the contents of the ``/examples/`` directory into a single "
